/**
 * progen finding F42 (branch arm). The arms of the `if` are `null` and `1.0`, so the branch is
 *   a `float?` and each arm is put into that form at its exit (design principles 3.8). The
 *   node that stands for an arm in the enclosing graph was made before the arms were joined
 *   and kept the slot of what the arm gave then, a `float`. Without a pass nothing reads that
